3. Admin panel — HTML additions

a) Add a tab button — inside ADMIN_HTML, find the <nav class="tabs"> block and add this line after the "Suppliers" tab (or after "AI Tools" if no Suppliers tab exists):

```html
<button class="tab" data-tab="social">Social Media</button>
```

b) Add the panel — find the panel for the last tab you have (e.g. <div class="tab-panel hidden" id="panel-settings">) and paste this right before it:

```html
<div class="tab-panel hidden" id="panel-social">
  <div class="between mb-16">
    <h2 style="margin:0;font-size:18px;">Social Media Connections</h2>
    <button class="btn sm" id="connectSocialBtn">+ Connect platform</button>
  </div>
