</div>
```

c) Add a social strip to the storefront footer — inside STORE_HTML, find <main class="container"> and paste this after its closing </main>:

```html
<footer class="container" style="padding:32px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);">
  <div id="storeSocial" style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;"></div>
</footer>
